// BT-4115: an Error subclass that overrides `class signal:`. A class-literal
// `Bt4115LoudError signal: m` must keep the class send so the override runs,
// rather than being inlined to the caller-safe `classSignal:` primitive.

Error subclass: Bt4115LoudError

  class signal: msg :: String -> Never => super signal: "loud: " ++ msg
